  "notes": "Refrain (bars 1-4) + verse (bars 5-9) + refrain again (bars 10-13), transposed from G to C. Bar 5 uses the rising C-D-E-F-G line (flutetree and Musica Viva agree; Wikipedia has a repeated-note variant). Bars 7-8 alternate G4 and G3 per all three sources; bar 9 is the held G4 whole note (flutetree). Refrain bar 4 written as a half note both times. Dotted-quarter + eighth is intrinsic to the tune."
